Media and Historical Source Material
------------------------------------

Bundled or downloadable historical media is not relicensed under MIT unless
explicitly stated. Media entries keep their own provenance, source URL,
institution, and license metadata in:

- src/game/mediaCatalog.js
- src/game/audioCatalog.js
- src/game/historicalAssetManifest.js
- docs/media-sourcing.md
- docs/historical_assets_curation.md

Public-domain and permissively licensed assets may be used in the public app
when their catalog entry is marked verified. Assets marked needs-review or
recording-needed are placeholders or local development targets and should not
be treated as public release assets.

Historical/Educational Scope
----------------------------

Titans of War is intended as an educational strategy simulation. It presents
historical command pressures, logistics, morale, political factions, and
alternate-history branches for study and gameplay. It is not an endorsement of
any historical faction or ideology.
